      "Ninja lists 1,500 watts and air up to 450°F, higher than most compact air fryers",
      "Includes a 4-quart and a 6-cup TempWare glass container with storage lids",
      "Glass containers and lids listed as microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe",
      "No coated cooking surface to wear out",
      "Cook, serve and store leftovers in the same container"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "4-quart maximum suits one to three people, not a large family",
      "Ninja says the glass is not oven or stovetop safe",
