                The US FN101 kit includes a 4-quart glass container and a 6-cup (1.5-quart) glass container. Ninja says the 4-quart container fits up to 4 pounds of wings or 2 pounds of fries. Some retailer bundles add a 2.5-quart container. Other regions sell the Crispi with metric container sizes and a different power rating.
