                Ninja lists the US Crispi at up to 450°F, delivered by a 1,500-watt PowerPod. That is higher than many compact basket air fryers, which commonly top out at 400°F. The highest setting is used by the Max Crisp function, which is aimed at frozen foods like fries and nuggets that need fast surface browning.
